stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  state "Ended, history kept" as Kept
  state "Ended, one person withdrew" as Withdrawn
  [*] --> Active: invite accepted
  Active --> Paused: either pauses
  Paused --> Active: both agree
  Active --> Kept: either ends
  Active --> Withdrawn: end and withdraw
  Kept --> Withdrawn: withdraw later
  Kept --> Active: reopen,<br/>both agree
  Withdrawn --> Active: rejoin, the one<br/>who stayed accepts
